      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport Chandigarh Safe</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When arranging professional bike transport in Chandigarh, meticulous documentation is the cornerstone of a seamless and secure transit experience. Unlike standard courier services, motorized vehicle shipping requires specific legal and logistical paperwork to ensure compliance with transport regulations and to protect your asset during its journey.</p>
<p>Neglecting these formalities can lead to significant delays, customs issues, or, worse, denied claims in the event of an accident. By preparing the correct documents in advance, you ensure that your two-wheeler moves smoothly from the pickup point in Chandigarh to its final destination without bureaucratic hurdles.</p>

<p>The foundation of any transport request begins with proof of ownership. You must provide a <strong>self-attested photocopy of the Registration Certificate (RC)</strong>. This document verifies that you are the legal owner of the vehicle and is mandatory for the transporter to issue a valid consignment note.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Alongside the RC, the <strong>current Pollution Under Control (PUC) certificate</strong> is essential.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>While the bike may not be driven during transit, transport authorities and logistics partners often require this to confirm that the vehicle is road-legal and well-maintained prior to loading.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>Furthermore, a <strong>valid insurance certificate</strong> for the vehicle itself must be presented to demonstrate that the bike is covered against third-party liabilities and personal accidents during the period of transport.</span></li></ul>

<p>However, the most critical document for the logistics process is the <strong>IBA-approved consignment bilty</strong>. This document serves as the official contract between the shipper and the transporter, detailing the weight, dimensions, and value of the consignment. It acts as the receipt and the legal basis for any compensation claims.</p>
<p>To generate this, you must accurately declare the value of your motorcycle. This is where the importance of <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong> becomes undeniable.</p>

<p>Standard vehicle insurance often excludes coverage when the bike is being transported on a carrier. Therefore, specific marine cargo insurance is required. Opting for coverage at 100% of the declared value ensures that if any damage, theft, or total loss occurs during transit, you are fully compensated.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">This policy covers risks such as accidental collisions, fire, and natural disasters while the bike is in the transporter’s custody.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>By combining these four essential documents—the self-attested RC, current PUC, valid vehicle insurance, and the IBA-approved bilty with comprehensive marine cover—you create a robust safety net.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This preparation not only facilitates a faster pickup and dispatch process in Chandigarh but also provides you with the peace of mind that your valued asset is protected from door to door.</span></li></ul></div>
